"To convert $555_{10}$ to base $5$, we repeatedly divide the number by $5$ and keep track of the remainders.\n\n1. Divide $555$ by $5$:\n   \\[\n   555 \\div 5 = 111 \\quad \\text{remainder} \\quad 0\n   \\]\n\n2. Divide $111$ by $5$:\n   \\[\n   111 \\div 5 = 22 \\quad \\text{remainder} \\quad 1\n   \\]\n\n3. Divide $22$ by $5$:\n   \\[\n   22 \\div 5 = 4 \\quad \\text{remainder} \\quad 2\n   \\]\n\n4. Divide $4$ by $5$:\n   \\[\n   4 \\div 5 = 0 \\quad \\text{remainder} \\quad 4\n   \\]\n\nReading the remainders from bottom to top, we get $4210_5$.\n\n$Final Answer: $ The answer is $\\boxed{4210_5}$."
